// CONTRACT BEAT (seeded by the lead; owned by east): asserts hasBadge(bloom)
// and hands over hmFly.

## The greenhouse

::bg{location="bloom-gym" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="calm" volume="down"}
@narrator: The Bloom Gym is a greenhouse full of sleeping flowers. At the far end, in a wicker chair, a woman is also asleep.
@narrator{when="holds(defeated(bloomGymLassRose)) && holds(defeated(bloomGymBeautyLily)) && holds(defeated(bloomGymPicnickerIvy))"}: Her trainers cough, loudly and together. She wakes.

## Fern

::use{component="gymLeader" who="fern" badge="bloom" intro="Hello. Lovely weather, isn't it? It's so pleasant. Oh dear, I must have dozed off. Welcome. My name is Fern. I am the leader here." win="Oh! I concede defeat. You are remarkably strong. I must confer on you the Bloom Badge." lose="Oh, that was a pleasant battle. Do come again." prize="2900"}
<match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    @fern{emotion="happy"}: And take this too. My flying monsters carried me home from every town in Verdane, on the days I fell asleep somewhere else.
    ::use{component="obtain" item="hmFly"}
    @fern: A boy came through this morning, very loud. He beat me, and then he fell asleep on the bench. I let him. He looked like he needed it.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator: The scent of flowers follows you out of the gym.
  </otherwise>
</match>
